OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FA frosty morning for many, and  
OL,6,Fcold throughout the day despite the    
OL,7,Flong sunny spells and light breeze.    
OL,8,FPatches of fog in prone rural areas    
OL,9,Fmay be slow to lift. Shaded areas may  
OL,10,Fstay frosty or icy throughout the day. 
OL,12,CTonight:FDry, with clear spells at     
OL,13,Ffirst. A cold night, though with       
OL,14,Ftemperatures a touch higher than on    
OL,15,FSunday night, with only a touch of     
OL,16,Ffrost in rural spots.                  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
