OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CTuesday:FCold, wet and breezy. Cloud   
OL,6,Fwill thicken during the morning with a 
OL,7,Ffreshening breeze. Rain is likely to   
OL,8,Farrive in the afternoon, with heavier  
OL,9,Fspells possible.                       
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FPatchy
OL,12,Frain to start on Wednesday, but later  
OL,13,Fdry, cloudy and cold. Longer breaks to 
OL,14,Fsunshine on Thursday, but cold. Rain,  
OL,15,Fstrengthening winds, and hill snow     
OL,16,Freturning later on Friday.             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
